

## `.gitignore` File for Pilang Project

```gitignore
# Compiled object files
*.o
*.obj

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.txt

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lib
*.a

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.wasm


# Debug files
*.log
*.tmp


#log files
*.log

# Build directories
build/
dist/
bin/
emsdk/
docs/
micrograd/


# Emscripten cache
.cache/
emscripten_cache/

# IDE-specific files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace





#site

piscript-site/

#formatter and minifiers
# JS/


#release files
release/


# macOS
.DS_Store

